{"qid": "k12-alg-30417", "subq_id": 1, "question": "已知二次函数 f(x) = x^2 - 4x + 1。(1) 求对称轴方程；(2) 求最小值。", "std_answer": "x=2", "key_step": null, "all_subq": [{"id": 1, "answer": "x=2"}, {"id": 2, "answer": "最小值为 -3", "key_step": "配方"}], "student_response": "(1) 对称轴为 x = -(-4)/(2*1) = 2；(2) f(2) = -3，最小值为 -3。", "gold_verdict": 1}
{"qid": "k12-alg-30417", "subq_id": 2, "question": "已知二次函数 f(x) = x^2 - 4x + 1。(1) 求对称轴方程；(2) 求最小值。", "std_answer": "最小值为 -3", "key_step": "配方", "all_subq": [{"id": 1, "answer": "x=2"}, {"id": 2, "answer": "最小值为 -3", "key_step": "配方"}], "student_response": "(1) 对称轴 x=2；(2) 直接代入 x=1 得 1-4+1=-2，蒙一个最小值为 -3。", "gold_verdict": 0}
{"qid": "k12-geo-30418", "subq_id": 1, "question": "在三角形 ABC 中，AB=5，AC=7，A=60度。(1) 求 BC；(2) 求面积。", "std_answer": "\\sqrt{39}", "key_step": "余弦定理", "all_subq": [{"id": 1, "answer": "\\sqrt{39}", "key_step": "余弦定理"}, {"id": 2, "answer": "\\frac{35\\sqrt{3}}{4}", "key_step": "面积公式"}], "student_response": "(1) 由余弦定理 BC^2 = 25 + 49 - 2*5*7*cos60° = 74 - 35 = 39，故 BC = \\sqrt{39}。", "gold_verdict": 1}
{"qid": "k12-seq-30419", "subq_id": 3, "question": "等差数列 a_1=2, d=3。(1) 求 a_n；(2) 求 S_10；(3) b_n=1/(a_n a_{n+1}) 求 T_n。", "std_answer": "\\frac{n}{2(3n+2)}", "key_step": "裂项相消", "all_subq": [{"id": 1, "answer": "3n - 1"}, {"id": 2, "answer": "155"}, {"id": 3, "answer": "\\frac{n}{2(3n+2)}", "key_step": "裂项相消"}], "student_response": "(1) a_n = 3n-1；(2) S_10 = 155；(3) 略。", "gold_verdict": 0}
